  "details": "1. Open the website and log in. 2. Make a group, then go to group settings. 3. Go to group Links and submit a link such as \"discord.gg/vrchat.\" 4. Click \"Ok,\" and nothing will happen anymore. The UI does not light up. \n\nPlatform: Edge / Crome\n\n(While checking to see if it happened on other engines, I noticed it can be clicked while the box is empty.)\n\nLink to video: https://youtu.be/kuSrbzECsLw",
